Answering Machine","titleOriginal":null,"urlSlug":"the-answering-machine","duration":90,"productionYear":null,"description":null,"contentRating":null,"productionCountries":[],"genres":[],"directors":[],"actors":[],"thumbnailImage":null,"trailers":[]}},{"name":"Der Himmel \u00fcber Berlin","beginning":"2026-11-06T20:00:00+01:00","urlSlug":"64523","deeplink":null,"flags":[],"subtitleLanguage":null,"auditorium":{"name":"Kino 3"},"cinema":{"urlSlug":"babylon-berlin","city":{"urlSlug":"berlin"}},"movie":{"id":"1575039","title":"Der Himmel \u00fcber Berlin","titleOriginal":"Der Himmel \u00fcber Berlin","urlSlug":"der-himmel-uber-berlin","duration":128,"productionYear":null,"description":"Damiel ist ein Engel. Und gemeinsam mit seinem himmlischen Kollegen Cassiel wandert er durch das geteilte Berlin und wacht \u00fcber die Menschen. Doch als Engel bleibt Damiel der menschlichen Welt verborgen. Er kann sie nur beobachten und ihren Gedanken lauschen, mitf\u00fchlen und miterleben kann er ihre Empfindungen nicht. Als er sich eines Tages in die zauberhafte Trapezk\u00fcnstlerin Marion verliebt, beschlie\u00dft er, selbst ein Mensch zu werden. Doch daf\u00fcr muss er ein gro\u00dfes Opfer bringen: seine Unsterblichkeit.","contentRating":{"minimumAge":6},"productionCountries":[{"name":"Germany"},{"name":"France"}],"genres":[{"name":"Drama"},{"name":"Fantasy"},{"name":"Lovestory"}],"directors":[],"actors":[],"thumbnailImage":{"url":"https:\/\/static.kinoheld.de\/images\/film\/4\/der-himmel-ueber-berlin-9307.v17404442441011.jpg"},"trailers":[{"url":"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=_Zih4o6NLCc"}]}},{"name":"S\u00fcd-Korea: Memories of Murder","beginning":"2026-11-06T21:45:00+01:00","urlSlug":"64524","deeplink":null,"flags":[],"subtitleLanguage":null,"auditorium":{"name":"Kino 2"},"cinema":{"urlSlug":"babylon-berlin","city":{"urlSlug":"berlin"}},"movie":{"id":"1575033","title":"S\u00fcd-Korea: Memories of Murder","titleOriginal":null,"urlSlug":"sud-korea-memories-of-murder","dura